==============================================================================
B1c/B2c. Class errors e(b,m), tie law, and Delta_m formula (n<=24)
==============================================================================
  tie law check: e(1,n-1) == e(1,n-2)  iff  8|n ;  e(0,m) > e(1,m) strict
  mod-8 tie law verified n=3..24: True;  b=0 strictly worse: True

  Delta_m := e(1,m)-e(1,m+1) (error scale). Formula: 2^{n-m-1}*C(m,k0)*(4-r)
  with c=a+4m, a=n+4, k0 unique in [0,m] with |8k0-c|<4, r=|8k0-c|, else 0.
  n=5: recovered scale = 1/800 ; all m match formula*scale: True
    m=0: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=1: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=2: Delta(error)=3/200  formula=12  scale*formula=3/200
    m=3: Delta(error)=1/400  formula=2  scale*formula=1/400
  n=8: recovered scale = 1/10240 ; all m match formula*scale: True
    m=0: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=1: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=2: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=3: Delta(error)=1/160  formula=64  scale*formula=1/160
    m=4: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=0
    m=5: Delta(error)=1/128  formula=80  scale*formula=1/128
    m=6: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=0
  n=12: recovered scale = 1/245760 ; all m match formula*scale: True
    m=0: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=1: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=2: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=3: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=None
    m=4: Delta(error)=1/480  formula=512  scale*formula=1/480
    m=5: Delta(error)=0  formula=0  scale*formula=0
    m=6: Delta(error)=1/320  formula=768  scale*formula=1/320
